{"articleNo":"245275","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=245275&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[부속기관] ★ 금오톡톡 kit-톡 및 채널 다이어트 시행 안내 ★","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2020.11.25","hit":"27151","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">「금오톡톡&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">kit-</span></b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>톡 및 채널 다이어트」</b>를 다음과 같이 시행하고자</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">안내드리오니 적극 협조해 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right: 5pt;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">추진 배경</span></b></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"text-indent: -50.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">수시로 오는&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">PUSH·</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">문자 알림으로 중요 공지사항 및 수업 관련&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">kit-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">톡 확인 어려움</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;, 돋움, AppleSDGothicNeo, Dotum, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; text-indent: -50.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;</span></span>kit-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">톡 시행 후에도 문자 발송량의 지속 증가로&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">UMS</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">사용료 전년대비&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">배 증가 예상</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; * 19</span><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">년 사용료 약&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2,750</span><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">만원을&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">월중 전액 소진</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">금년&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">5,500</span><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\">만원 소요 예상</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 16px;\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 16px;\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">2. 주요 내용</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">kit-</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">톡 및 문자 다이어트</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><b><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">kit-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">톡 발송시 기본 전송방식 변경</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -50.4px; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">금오톡톡</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -50.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 244, 192);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197); color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\"><b>※</b></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197); color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\"><b>&nbsp;중요한 메시지 발송 시 [금오톡톡→문자]로 직접 변경하여 발송</b></span>이&nbsp;가능합니다.</span></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -82.4px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※ 11.24. 기준&nbsp;신분별 금오톡톡 설치율 참고 : 학부재학생 92%, 대학원재학생 69%, 교수 59%, 직원 48%</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBlHoEZPAjAHATgeQGYFECOBVALgO2VwA0AJAIQEMA1WAS1QDp58BzIA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; text-indent: -37.8pt; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: 휴먼명조;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 나</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-weight: bold; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">kit-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>톡 수신시 문자 전송 줄이기 :&nbsp;</b></span><b style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">kit-톡 수신 시에는</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">&nbsp;문자 재전송 안함 (</span></span></b><b style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -50.4px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">금오톡톡→문자인 경우)</span></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">금오톡톡 앱 설치 및 로그인 시&nbsp;금오톡톡 내 kit-톡 메뉴에 메시지가 수신됩니다.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -50.4px; background-color: rgb(250, 224, 212); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; -</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;PUSH알림이 울리면 PUSH배너를 선택하여 즉시 확인이 가능하고,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -50.4px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\">kit-톡 메뉴에서 언제든지 메시지 확인 가능합니다.</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -50.4px; background-color: rgb(250, 224, 212); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197);\">※&nbsp;</span></b></span></span><b style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197); color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">메시지를 읽지 않아도&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197); color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">kit-톡에 메시지가 수신되면&nbsp;수시 확인이 가능하므로&nbsp;문자&nbsp;재전송되지 않습니다.</span></span></span></b></p></div><div><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -37.8pt; background-color: rgb(250, 224, 212);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">kit-톡과 문자 이중으로 발송되어 문자 비용 과청구,&nbsp;동일 내용 중복 PUSH알림으로 중요 공지 확인 및 학업 방해 초래)</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -50.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197); color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\"><b>※ 금오톡톡 미확인으로 인한&nbsp;불이익이 없도록&nbsp;</b></span></span></span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -50.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 224, 212);\"><b><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197); color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">금오톡톡 앱 PUSH알림 시&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197); color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">확인을 생활화합시다.</span></b></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -37.8pt; background-color: rgb(250, 224, 212);\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><b style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 2.1em; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; font-weight: 700; text-indent: -50.4px;\">&nbsp; ○&nbsp;</span><b style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">채널 및&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">PUSH&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">다이어트</span></b><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">홈페이지 게시글 관련 채널 합치기&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">: 28</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">개&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">→<span style=\"color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">개</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><b><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">발송횟수 줄이고 휴식시간 발송</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">매시간&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">→&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">채널별&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">최대 일&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -37.8pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\">회</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBlHoEZPA3B3AlgLwKIDEAiBVA9t9AawCEBFABXWIFsBDAYQDoApcgcSA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBlHoEZPBXBTAXgEwB4CcASBHAMgBwDMBFATwFFSAlAWXIEMA7AOgCkAFAcSA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 45.5pt; text-indent: -45.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">★&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;\">대상자 자동 구독</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 45.5pt; text-indent: -45.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; text-indent: -60.6667px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※ 채널 구독/취소 방법 : 금오톡톡 메뉴 &gt; 채널 모두보기 &gt; … 선택 &gt; 구독/취소하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 45.5pt; text-indent: -45.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -45.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -45.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">채널은 수요자 요구</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -45.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -45.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">이용률 등 운영 상황에 따라 변동 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 32px;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; fon