lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">발송시각까지의 게시글을 모아 채널별&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;\">개의 메시지로 발송됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(204, 61, 61); background-color: rgb(250, 236, 197);\">발송시각 이후 게시글은 익일 발송</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조;\">시각에 발송되오니 여유를 두고 홈페이지 게시글 작성 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -51.0667px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ○ 금오톡톡 관련 문의·건의&nbsp;: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 18.6667px;\">정보전산원 홈페이지(<a href=\"https://cic.kumoh.ac.kr/cic/sub0304.do\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\"><u>금오톡톡수정요청 게시판</u></span></a><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 61, 61);\"><b></b></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 18.6667px; text-indent: -51.0667px;\">)</span><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\">정 보 전 산 원</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 37.8pt; text-indent: -37.8pt; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -61.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><br></span></b></span></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"31486\"></div></div><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
